About This File
================================================================================

This NOTICE file identifies third-party open source software that
storage-scale-test may download, build, or invoke at runtime. The
storage-scale-test
source repository itself is distributed under the Apache License 2.0 (see the
LICENSE file in this repository).

Third-party benchmark binaries (elbencho, Warp) are not bundled in this
repository. Helper scripts may download or build them on the machine where you
prepare a deployment tarball. Python packages listed below are installed into a
local virtual environment by setup scripts. Alpine Linux libraries listed below
are used when building static helper binaries (for example, s3test) inside an
Alpine Linux container.

Nothing in this file grants rights beyond those provided by the applicable
third-party license for each component. Full license texts are available at the
source URLs cited for each component.

